DTSTAMP:20261026T121804Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261019
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261020
SUMMARY:Bank of America: Took effect
DESCRIPTION:If you pay a Bank of America card or loan from an account at a
 nother bank\, BofA no longer investigates most errors or fraud on those p
 ayments. The other bank has to.\n\nhttps://quietlychanged.com/changes/202
 6-10-15-bank-of-america-narrows-error-and-fraud-protection-for-linked-ext
 ernal-account/
